{
  "$description": "Foundation colour primitives. Every value is read from the clone's tailwind.config.js / src/index.css / component class strings, cross-checked against CLONE_SPEC.md section 1.2 (Playwright-computed on the live site). Citation ids in $extensions.cite resolve in extraction/measured-values.json. The site is dark-only; there is no light palette in the source.",
